OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road reopens following
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road has reopened following a
OL,7,Fcrash involving two vehicles.
OL,9,FThe collision happened at about 04:00
OL,10,FGMT on the A37 Wells Road at its
OL,11,Fjunction with Airport Road and Wootton
OL,12,FPark in south Bristol.
OL,14,FWells Road and the A4174 Callington
OL,15,FRoad were closed in both directions for
OL,16,Fmost of the day while emergency
OL,17,Fservices were at the scene, but they
OL,18,Fhave since reopened.
OL,20,FAnyone who witnessed the incident is
OL,21,Furged to contact police.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
